1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,320
They didn't accept you if you weren't one of them.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:07,600
Several of them used to tell me that I shouldn't tell people that I was colored

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,600
because I didn't look it.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:20,600
And I still didn't feel this until I was older and started trying to get a job.

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,040
How did it manifest itself then?

6
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:29,880
The first time was when I went to the telephone company and I was very young.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:47,000
And I wanted to apply for a job. And the woman there in personnel asked me had I had any experience. And I told her no, that I had never held a job and that I had no kind of experience at all.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:00,000
And she did say that, well, she felt she had a job that I would enjoy, that I could learn very well. And she started filling out an application. And she was filling it out.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Until she came to nationality. And she asked me what was my nationality. And I was stunned because I had always felt that anyone could look at me and see what I was. And I told her I was colored. And she turned as red as a beet. And she said she was sorry she didn't have anything for me.

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
We're talking about when now?

11
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Now this was in...

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Thirty-nine?

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,000
No, no, no. This was in...

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,520
Forty. About forty-seven. Forty-seven or forty-eight.

